    !>
    !> where ``alpha`` is a scalar, ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are vectors, and ``A_i`` is an
    !> ``n`` by ``n`` symmetric matrix, supplied in packed form, for ``i`` = 1, ..., ``batchCount``.
    !>
    !> - Supported precisions in rocBLAS : ``s`` and ``d``.
