    !> - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_UPPER: The upper triangular part of each A_i is supplied in AP.
    !> - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER: The lower triangular part of each A_i is supplied in AP.
    !> @param[in]
    !> n         [int]
