    !> 3 6 8 9
    !> 4 7 9 0
    !> @param[in]
    !> batchCount [int]
    !> number of instances in the batch.
    function hipblasSspr2Batched(handle, uplo, n, alpha, x, incx, y, incy, AP, batchCount) &
