    !> @param[in]
    !> n         [int]
    !> n specifies the number of rows of each b_i. n >= 0.
    !>
    !> @param[in]
    !> AP         device pointer to the first matrix (A_1) in the batch, of dimension ( lda, n ).
    !>
    !> @param[in]
