    !> \brief  BLAS EX API
    !>
    !> \details
    !> The scalStridedBatchedEx functions scale each element of vector ``x`` with scalar alpha over
    !> a set
    !> of strided batched vectors.
    !>
    !> x := alpha * x
    !>
    !> The supported types are determined by the backend. See the rocBLAS or cuBLAS documentation.
    !>
    !> @param[in]
    !> handle    [hipblasHandle_t]
